{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L1RoZSUyMFJ1bSUyMERpYXJ5JTIwJTI4MjAxMSUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"The Rum Diary","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/uErFROiMrpk7owQWKK3bpD4hSJs.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jxsWn2D4pk0rgtO3hBzFq9rROZ8.jpg","description":"Tired of the noise and madness of New York and the crushing conventions of late Eisenhower-era America, itinerant journalist Paul Kemp travels to the pristine island of Puerto Rico to write for a local San Juan newspaper run by the downtrodden editor Lotterman. Adopting the rum-soaked lifestyle of the late ‘50s version of Hemingway’s 'The Lost Generation', Paul soon becomes entangled with a very attractive American woman and her fiancée, a businessman involved in shady property development deals.  It is within this world that Kemp ultimately discovers his true voice as a writer and integrity as a man.","releaseInfo":"2011","genres":["Comedy","Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.9","runtime":"120 min","cast":["Johnny Depp","Amber Heard","Aaron Eckhart","Michael Rispoli","Giovanni Ribisi","Richard Jenkins","Amaury Nolasco","Marshall Bell"],"director":["Bruce Robinson"],"released":"2011-10-13T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"One part outrage. One part justice. Three parts rum. Mix well.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Johnny Depp","character":"Paul Kemp","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/k2xt6EUxQDwYRKIyI4IBdZxfs8n.jpg"},{"name":"Amber Heard","character":"Chenault","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vnDolRlZWiOLBg1N0hsUTz4OH4C.jpg"},{"name":"Aaron Eckhart","character":"Sanderson","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5EFQvRHlpP1Iaw2e6vjOaBny6DV.jpg"},{"name":"Michael Rispoli","character":"Sala","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4rtCKJTtPq9cSHFQqZSbyCLLWCO.jpg"},{"name":"Giovanni Ribisi","character":"Moberg","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8EAiS9D3YtGOrwNM0OrwmDpWK7s.jpg"},{"name":"Richard Jenkins","charact